    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr. Bhavita Kumari from The Institute for Global Health and Development (IGHD) at Aga Khan University recently played a pivotal role in an event that marked a significant milestone in advocating for environmental awareness and action within Karachi's private school sector. This event, supported by the U.S. Mission in Pakistan and partnered with the Pakistan-U.S. Alumni Network, Sindh Education and Literacy Department, Private Schools Management Association, and the Pakistan Academic Consortium, has made a lasting impact on the educational landscape.",
